Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: secubox-identity
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox Identity — decentralized identity management
 Decentralized identity (DID) management for SecuBox: identity
 issuance, verification, and lifecycle. Distinct from user-account
 management (which is secubox-users' job).
 .
 Distinct from sibling packages in the identity stack:
  - secubox-users — local user accounts (Argon2id hashes, TOTP, RBAC).
  - secubox-auth — JWT auth guardian / session middleware.
  - secubox-portal — web login portal.
  - secubox-avatar — profile image + display-name manager.
